# unit_named_struct_call under --walk-methods: bump walked (pinned), its `Counter()` the walker's EXEC of Counter's
# procedure over Counter in bump's frames (§12), as its bare `Counter` would be.  Counter\n reads 1 after each call,
# though 5 was written before it.  Entry 7.
Counter:
    size_t: n 0U
    n: n + 1U
return
fn: bump () size_t
    Counter()
    size_t: v 9U
    v: Counter\n
return: v
Counter\n: 5U
Counter()
size_t: a 9U
a: Counter\n
Counter\n: 5U
Counter: ()
size_t: b 9U
b: Counter\n
Counter\n: 5U
size_t: c 9U
c: bump()
int: ok 0
if: a = 1U && b = 1U && c = 1U
    ok: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
